WEBVTT

00:11.030 --> 00:15.780
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:11.030 --> 00:15.780
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:15.950 --> 00:20.200
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:15.950 --> 00:20.200
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:20.370 --> 00:24.000
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:20.370 --> 00:24.000
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:32.840 --> 00:36.180
<i>Since when was it?</i>

00:32.840 --> 00:36.180
<i>are itsukarada?</i>

00:36.340 --> 00:39.100
<i>Being honest became whining</i>

00:36.340 --> 00:39.100
<i>honne ga yowane ni nattana</i>

00:39.260 --> 00:41.640
<i>Standing firm became strength</i>

00:39.260 --> 00:41.640
<i>nigenai koto ga tsuyosa ni natta</i>

00:41.810 --> 00:44.940
<i>Have you found it yet?</i>

00:41.810 --> 00:44.940
<i>naa mitsukaranai?</i>

00:45.100 --> 00:49.320
<i>Not confidence, your true self</i>

00:45.100 --> 00:49.320
<i>jishin janaku jibun jishin</i>

00:50.610 --> 00:54.820
<i>There must be something
I've forgotten that I still haven't found</i>

00:50.610 --> 00:54.820
<i>kitto mada sagasetenai wasuremono ga aruhazu</i>

00:54.990 --> 00:59.160
<i>Words I want to say
That I still haven't said</i>

00:54.990 --> 00:59.160
<i>zutto mada tsutaetenai tsutaetai kotoba</i>

00:59.330 --> 01:04.540
<i>If you would watch me, I'd captivate you</i>

00:59.330 --> 01:04.540
<i>mitete kurerunara misete miserunoni</i>

01:04.710 --> 01:09.500
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

01:04.710 --> 01:09.500
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

01:09.710 --> 01:13.710
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

01:09.710 --> 01:13.710
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

01:13.880 --> 01:17.720
<i>I smolder because I've actually burned</i>

01:13.880 --> 01:17.720
<i>kusuburuno wa chanto moeta karada</i>

01:17.890 --> 01:22.810
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

01:17.890 --> 01:22.810
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

01:22.970 --> 01:27.770
<i>I'll just open my eyes</i>

01:22.970 --> 01:27.770
<i>tada me wo mihiraite</i>

01:27.940 --> 01:31.520
<i>And dream my dream</i>

01:27.940 --> 01:31.520
<i>yume wo miru</i>

01:31.690 --> 01:33.860
<i>And know my dream</i>

01:31.690 --> 01:33.860
<i>yume wo shiru</i>

01:42.200 --> 01:50.580
HYUNCKEL, THE DARK SWORDSMAN

01:53.250 --> 01:54.190
It's not over!

01:54.190 --> 01:55.230
That stance...!

01:55.230 --> 01:56.840
Avan Strash!

02:05.430 --> 02:08.870
You call this Avan Strash?
Don't make me laugh!

02:08.870 --> 02:10.770
That was just a cheap imitation!

02:11.860 --> 02:16.530
You know the lesson, "Slice the earth,
slice the sea, slice the air.

02:17.030 --> 02:20.200
And what slices everything
is Avan Strash."

02:20.660 --> 02:26.080
Fighting you, I could tell you haven't
mastered the Avan Style Sword Technique!

02:26.410 --> 02:30.770
In other words,
the third skill, Air Slash!

02:30.770 --> 02:32.170
Air Slash?!

02:33.250 --> 02:34.560
<i>That's right...</i>

02:34.560 --> 02:35.840
<i>Dai...</i>

02:36.760 --> 02:40.030
Even if you complete
the Special Hard Course,

02:40.030 --> 02:42.820
you'll probably learn Air Slash
on the seventh day.

02:42.820 --> 02:43.610
The last?

02:43.610 --> 02:47.470
Yes. It's that difficult
of a skill to learn.

02:48.350 --> 02:53.750
<i>But I only trained
with Master Avan for three days.</i>

02:53.750 --> 02:56.250
Even I can't use Air Slash.

02:56.250 --> 02:59.510
It's the greatest
Avan Style Sword Technique.

02:59.510 --> 03:04.050
When Earth, Wave, and Air are mastered,

03:04.050 --> 03:07.680
Avan Strash shows its true ultimate power!

03:07.680 --> 03:12.430
Basically, your attack now
is merely an incomplete imitation!

03:12.430 --> 03:15.250
Even I can use an imitation like that!

03:16.090 --> 03:18.210
Avan Strash!

03:23.840 --> 03:25.100
Dai!

03:28.140 --> 03:31.040
So you two are up next?

03:31.040 --> 03:34.290
We won't let you use
Master Avan's skills for evil!

03:34.290 --> 03:35.770
Three against one...

03:36.150 --> 03:39.490
Then I'll have to use my secret weapon.

03:41.820 --> 03:44.550
As a warrior, I can't use spells.

03:44.550 --> 03:49.560
So Vearn, the Dark King,
gave me the ultimate armour.

03:49.560 --> 03:54.100
A supreme armour that can repel
any and all attack spells!

03:54.100 --> 03:57.270
When I don it, I become unbeatable!

03:57.270 --> 04:01.070
A supreme armour?
I don't see any armour anywhere!

04:01.070 --> 04:03.880
Look closely. It's right in front of you!

04:05.680 --> 04:06.470
Amdo!

04:25.990 --> 04:27.630
His sword is his armour?!

04:27.630 --> 04:32.390
That's right. This Dark Armour Blade
is both the ultimate weapon

04:32.390 --> 04:34.870
and the ultimate armour!

04:35.960 --> 04:37.840
H-He's bluffing! Let's go!

04:39.290 --> 04:40.340
Frizzle!

04:47.930 --> 04:49.110
It's not working!

04:49.110 --> 04:50.810
How about this?!

04:50.810 --> 04:51.810
Sizz!

04:58.060 --> 04:59.230
Dammit!

05:04.280 --> 05:05.400
Popp!

05:06.110 --> 05:10.450
Dammit! I just learned that spell!

05:10.950 --> 05:13.930
Now do you see why I'm unbeatable?

05:13.930 --> 05:17.230
This armour is impervious
to all attack spells.

05:17.230 --> 05:21.340
And no one in the world
can best me at sword fighting.

05:24.970 --> 05:27.950
Don't. I won't fight a woman.

05:27.950 --> 05:31.950
Don't underestimate me!
Even women can risk their lives in battle!

05:31.950 --> 05:34.280
Even more so, if it's for justice!

05:34.280 --> 05:37.120
A likely lesson from Avan.

05:37.120 --> 05:39.270
You learned it too, didn't you?!

05:39.610 --> 05:44.070
Master Avan would never grant
an Insignia of Avan to someone unworthy!

05:44.610 --> 05:46.360
I know that deep down...

05:47.950 --> 05:49.070
This?

05:52.080 --> 05:53.620
How could you?!

05:54.240 --> 05:55.930
I don't need it.

05:55.930 --> 06:01.960
I only carried it around
to find Avan or his students...

06:02.460 --> 06:05.670
so I could kill them myself!

06:06.010 --> 06:09.240
Why?! Why do you hate him so much?!

06:09.240 --> 06:13.740
Because Avan is my father's killer!

06:13.740 --> 06:14.930
His killer?!

06:17.180 --> 06:21.690
This continent of Holkia
was once the Dark Lord Hadlar's base.

06:22.610 --> 06:28.240
<i>The old Dark Army razed towns
and was the cause of many casualties.</i>

06:36.080 --> 06:37.390
Poor thing...

06:37.390 --> 06:39.120
<i>That child was me.</i>

06:39.710 --> 06:44.840
<i>I was raised in Hadlar's Underground
Palace by the Hell Knight Bartos.</i>

06:45.630 --> 06:49.530
<i>The only reason he was allowed to
raise a human child was because</i>

06:49.530 --> 06:52.780
<i>Bartos was the strongest knight
in the Dark Army.</i>

06:52.780 --> 06:57.430
<i>And he was the guardian of the Hell Gate
which led to Hadlar's chambers.</i>

06:58.980 --> 07:01.150
I shall name you Hyunckel

07:01.600 --> 07:05.320
after a legendary swordsman
who once ruled the Underworld.

07:09.400 --> 07:16.040
<i>I couldn't leave the Palace,
but I grew up without questioning it.</i>

07:17.200 --> 07:18.100
Ta-da!

07:18.100 --> 07:19.430
Is this for me?

07:19.430 --> 07:20.330
Yeah!

07:25.210 --> 07:30.760
<i>As my father, Bartos was
the first man to teach me warmth.</i>

07:32.890 --> 07:34.390
<i>He's just like me...</i>

07:34.760 --> 07:36.220
But one day...

07:37.850 --> 07:40.390
Sir Bartos! The Hero is attacking!

07:40.730 --> 07:41.980
He's finally come!

07:44.270 --> 07:49.780
Hyunckel, as guardian of the Dark Lord,
I must fight the Heroes.

07:50.190 --> 07:52.400
It's possible I may die.

07:52.700 --> 07:53.780
Dad...!

07:55.570 --> 07:57.850
You mustn't leave this place!

07:57.850 --> 08:00.950
Should I die,
I hope you'll grow up strong!

08:01.710 --> 08:02.750
Dad!

08:03.170 --> 08:04.630
Dad!

08:16.260 --> 08:20.810
<i>With the Dark Lord's death cry,
all fell silent.</i>

08:23.520 --> 08:24.730
Dad!

08:30.440 --> 08:31.690
Dad?!

08:32.570 --> 08:33.280
Dad!

08:38.530 --> 08:41.060
<i>The Undead, unlike other monsters,</i>

08:41.060 --> 08:44.580
<i>cannot maintain themselves
without the Dark Lord's power.</i>

08:44.920 --> 08:48.520
<i>With Hadlar's death,
and the loss of his Dark Power,</i>

08:48.520 --> 08:50.130
<i>my father...</i>

08:50.750 --> 08:53.550
H-Hyunckel...

08:57.800 --> 08:58.890
Dad!

09:00.140 --> 09:04.890
Hyunckel... thank you for the memories...

09:08.520 --> 09:10.860
<i>He crumbled to ashes.</i>

09:12.230 --> 09:15.650
Dad!

09:18.570 --> 09:19.780
<i>It's ironic.</i>

09:20.450 --> 09:24.470
<i>The man who happened to find me was Avan.</i>

09:24.470 --> 09:25.290
You are...?

09:28.080 --> 09:29.440
Hyunckel.

09:29.440 --> 09:33.110
<i>He had no way of knowing who I was.</i>

09:33.110 --> 09:37.260
<i>He must have assumed I was a boy
kidnapped by monsters.</i>

09:37.630 --> 09:44.520
<i>But I knew immediately that
he was the Hero, and my father's killer.</i>

09:45.390 --> 09:51.360
At that moment, I swore
that I'd gain strength and kill him!

09:52.190 --> 09:55.500
That's why I became Avan's student
and learned to fight.

09:55.500 --> 09:58.840
So that I could kill him
with what he taught me!

09:58.840 --> 10:00.410
Stop it!

10:01.120 --> 10:04.220
I know how you feel, but Master Avan...

10:04.220 --> 10:07.120
"Was just fighting for justice"?!

10:08.170 --> 10:14.800
Justice or not, it doesn't change
the fact that he took my father's life!

10:15.260 --> 10:17.860
My father died as ashes.

10:17.860 --> 10:19.760
If that is justice...

10:20.340 --> 10:23.100
then justice itself is my enemy!

10:25.180 --> 10:26.950
Now to finish you off...

10:26.950 --> 10:31.690
My own special attack
that I intended to use on Avan!

10:32.020 --> 10:33.480
A sword from his helmet?!

10:36.030 --> 10:37.440
Take this!

10:38.530 --> 10:39.410
Look out!

10:42.700 --> 10:44.330
Dai! Popp!

10:48.160 --> 10:54.000
This is the attack I developed to defeat
the Avan Style Sword Technique...

10:54.920 --> 10:56.920
Bloody Scryde!

10:58.470 --> 11:04.220
Hyunckel, you've gained the skills
of a full-fledged warrior.

11:04.470 --> 11:07.350
And so, I present you with this.

11:09.310 --> 11:10.020
This is...?

11:10.440 --> 11:13.310
Consider it a certificate of graduation.

11:13.940 --> 11:17.420
But you're far from
being a complete warrior.

11:17.420 --> 11:23.240
Your blade seems to have
a strange malice or animosity to it.

11:23.820 --> 11:25.140
Master...

11:25.140 --> 11:26.300
Yes?

11:26.300 --> 11:30.250
Do you know a man named Bartos?

11:30.660 --> 11:31.680
Hyunckel?

11:31.680 --> 11:35.690
Bartos was the strongest knight
of the Dark Army...

11:35.690 --> 11:37.500
and my father!

11:38.920 --> 11:45.410
The malice you sense in my blade is
my hatred towards you, my father's killer!

11:45.410 --> 11:46.930
Wait, Hyunckel!

11:53.350 --> 11:54.610
Hyunckel!

11:55.860 --> 11:56.860
Hyunckel!

12:00.610 --> 12:03.990
<i>What have I done?
I instinctively fought back!</i>

12:04.950 --> 12:09.180
<i>But if I hadn't,
I'm sure he would have killed me.</i>

12:09.180 --> 12:13.330
<i>What talent with a blade!
It was like a demon's sword!</i>

12:14.120 --> 12:15.330
Hyunckel!

12:16.460 --> 12:18.000
Hyunckel!

12:29.100 --> 12:30.180
Avan...!

12:30.680 --> 12:34.790
<i>I failed, but I was rescued
by the Dark King's trusted servant,</i>

12:34.790 --> 12:39.150
<i>Mystvearn, the Shadow Vizier,
and survived.</i>

12:39.980 --> 12:45.050
Since then, I've continued to train
as a warrior of the Dark Army.

12:45.050 --> 12:49.240
This attack now far surpasses
the power of Avan Strash!

12:49.990 --> 12:54.000
Your ill-advised dodging
has only increased your suffering.

12:54.330 --> 12:56.290
Let me end it for you!

13:00.960 --> 13:03.470
MAGIC BULLET GUN

13:05.970 --> 13:08.470
KABOOM
EXPLOSION-TYPE SPELL

13:09.180 --> 13:12.350
<i>He's strong!
Stronger than anyone we've faced before!</i>

13:13.020 --> 13:15.890
<i>Is he really unbeatable?!</i>

13:16.230 --> 13:18.370
<i>No. That's impossible!</i>

13:18.370 --> 13:22.740
<i>Everyone has a weakness,
no matter how strong!</i>

13:25.990 --> 13:27.470
Give it up.

13:27.470 --> 13:29.470
No, I'll never give up!

13:29.470 --> 13:34.770
Even if that bullet contains
a Kasizz or Kaboom,

13:34.770 --> 13:37.310
you won't be able to scratch my armour.

13:37.310 --> 13:41.000
We'll see. You never know unless you try!

13:45.840 --> 13:47.760
Is this Dazzle?!

13:49.720 --> 13:51.510
Curse your foolish games.

14:02.320 --> 14:07.780
If I use my inner eye to sense
your presence, your Dazzle is useless.

14:08.700 --> 14:09.910
Maam!

14:13.330 --> 14:17.870
<i>Right there! If I can hit him there,
an attack spell should work!</i>

14:18.790 --> 14:20.500
It's all or nothing!

14:21.000 --> 14:21.960
Frizz!

14:26.470 --> 14:27.970
He dodged it!

14:30.140 --> 14:31.410
You brat!

14:31.410 --> 14:32.850
Look out! Run!

14:35.470 --> 14:36.140
Frizz!

14:39.900 --> 14:40.810
Wave Slash?!

14:47.030 --> 14:50.340
You have no power,
yet you insist on troubling me!

14:50.340 --> 14:51.490
Darn it!

14:57.620 --> 15:01.330
You have spirit.
That much is worth praise.

15:02.000 --> 15:04.800
<i>Is Dai really no match for him?!</i>

15:05.250 --> 15:11.550
<i>Sure he's a great swordsman,
but Dai's beaten Hadlar and Crocodine!</i>

15:12.300 --> 15:14.810
<i>I know! It's that mark!</i>

15:15.220 --> 15:20.270
<i>That mark has always allowed Dai
to use extraordinary power!</i>

15:23.020 --> 15:27.820
Dai! Use that power!
Use the power of that mark!

15:29.280 --> 15:32.200
What are you babbling about now?

15:32.910 --> 15:37.120
What's wrong, Dai?!
Get mad! Get mad and fight!

15:37.540 --> 15:39.830
Why won't you get mad, Dai?!

15:42.330 --> 15:44.770
<i>My father died as ashes.</i>

15:44.770 --> 15:47.180
<i>If that is justice...</i>

15:47.180 --> 15:50.260
<i>then justice itself is my enemy!</i>

15:51.260 --> 15:52.590
Dai!

15:52.930 --> 15:56.720
This should keep you from using
your bothersome tricks.

16:02.940 --> 16:03.980
What's that?!

16:07.520 --> 16:09.360
Dark Puppetry Aura Hand!

16:09.900 --> 16:13.820
This skill uses Dark Aura
to bind an opponent!

16:14.410 --> 16:17.580
Normally, it's used to control corpses.

16:17.830 --> 16:18.800
Darn it!

16:18.800 --> 16:22.430
And now, you're nothing but my puppet.

16:22.430 --> 16:23.770
Dai!

16:23.770 --> 16:25.750
This is the end!

16:27.920 --> 16:29.060
Die!

16:29.060 --> 16:31.010
Bloody Scryde!

16:34.220 --> 16:35.390
What?!

16:37.680 --> 16:38.890
Impossible!

16:39.260 --> 16:41.790
Yo, Hyunckel.

16:41.790 --> 16:44.020
Beast King Crocodine?!

16:46.400 --> 16:47.750
Crocodine...

16:47.750 --> 16:49.250
You survived?!

16:49.250 --> 16:50.940
What is the meaning of this?!

16:51.690 --> 16:53.200
Exactly what it looks like.

16:53.610 --> 16:55.160
I won't let you kill Dai!

17:01.700 --> 17:02.720
You there, boy!

17:02.720 --> 17:04.100
Yessir! What?!

17:04.100 --> 17:06.810
Take Dai and escape with that Garuda!

17:06.810 --> 17:07.840
Huh?!

17:09.210 --> 17:13.820
You're still too weak to defeat Hyunckel!
You have to escape!

17:13.820 --> 17:14.940
But...

17:14.940 --> 17:19.320
Some monsters will only obey
my direct commands.

17:19.320 --> 17:21.470
That Garuda is one of them.

17:21.850 --> 17:23.640
But Maam...

17:24.770 --> 17:26.210
Don't worry.

17:26.210 --> 17:31.570
Hyunckel isn't the type
to kill a girl, no matter the situation.

17:32.070 --> 17:34.340
I'll do something about the girl!

17:34.340 --> 17:37.010
Right now, you must escape with Dai!

17:37.010 --> 17:39.700
Do you think I'll just let that happen?!

17:40.240 --> 17:43.850
I'm still one of the Six
Legion Commanders of the Dark Army.

17:43.850 --> 17:46.600
I can take you down with me if I have to!

17:46.600 --> 17:47.900
You can't.

17:47.900 --> 17:50.630
You don't have the strength right now!

17:53.510 --> 17:55.030
I knew it.

17:55.030 --> 17:59.010
Your armour may be
brand new, but I can tell.

17:59.510 --> 18:03.430
Your wounds from your previous battle
haven't fully healed.

18:04.310 --> 18:09.250
Your steel hide is nothing more
than a cracked shield right now!

18:09.250 --> 18:10.650
Crocodine!

18:15.690 --> 18:16.610
No!

18:17.820 --> 18:19.220
Let go!

18:19.220 --> 18:22.410
Not even if it kills me!

18:26.750 --> 18:28.670
Wait! Maam's still...!

18:29.040 --> 18:30.630
Let me go!

18:30.960 --> 18:32.250
Crocodine!

18:32.590 --> 18:35.730
Of the Six Legion Commanders,

18:35.730 --> 18:40.340
I believed that at least you
and Baran were worth respecting!

18:40.680 --> 18:44.030
How disappointing
that you'd submit to a brat!

18:44.030 --> 18:50.480
I merely couldn't stand seeing someone
who beat me lose to someone else.

18:51.020 --> 18:54.730
The argument of the defeated.
How the Beast King has fallen.

18:55.150 --> 19:00.990
If you won't move,
I'll just have to run you through!

19:02.370 --> 19:03.580
So be it!

19:04.240 --> 19:09.020
Why would someone like you
care so much about them?!

19:09.020 --> 19:12.230
They're enemies of our Dark Army!

19:12.230 --> 19:14.550
"Our Dark Army..."

19:15.840 --> 19:17.050
What's so funny!

19:17.840 --> 19:22.550
It never seemed like you were
fighting for the Dark Army.

19:23.300 --> 19:28.390
You always looked like you were
fighting out of hatred for humans.

19:30.350 --> 19:31.980
I was the same.

19:32.940 --> 19:35.320
<i>I looked down on humans.</i>

19:35.980 --> 19:39.240
<i>I thought they were puny,
pathetic creatures.</i>

19:40.450 --> 19:43.720
<i>But fighting Dai and his friends
made me realize...</i>

19:43.720 --> 19:48.160
<i>humans are strong
and compassionate creatures!</i>

19:48.700 --> 19:53.330
<i>They can work together
and can share in joy and sadness!</i>

19:54.130 --> 19:58.190
<i>They're not like us monsters,
who are alone in our strength!</i>

19:58.190 --> 20:00.380
Shut up! Enough of your nonsense!

20:00.880 --> 20:05.850
There's no way a human like you
can't realize their greatness!

20:06.350 --> 20:09.180
Don't you see
that you're lying to yourself?!

20:10.930 --> 20:13.270
That's enough!

20:24.660 --> 20:25.910
<i>Tears?!</i>

20:32.460 --> 20:36.460
Hyunckel... it's good to be a human.

20:36.920 --> 20:41.550
When I'm reborn again,
I hope it's as... a human...

20:44.340 --> 20:45.840
Crocodine...

20:49.390 --> 20:50.990
Moruge.

20:50.990 --> 20:54.140
Is there a problem, Sir Hyunckel?

20:54.850 --> 20:56.830
Oh my! Isn't that...?!

20:56.830 --> 20:58.290
Tend to his wounds.

20:58.290 --> 21:01.340
Sir, I don't see
how he's going to survive.

21:01.340 --> 21:04.130
It doesn't matter. Consider it mercy.

21:04.130 --> 21:07.800
And take this woman
to the Underground Palace.

21:07.800 --> 21:09.550
Huh? Who is she?

21:09.550 --> 21:12.600
A hostage. Throw her in a cell.

21:12.600 --> 21:13.580
Yes, sir!

21:15.000 --> 21:20.700
<i>So long as I have her,
they're sure to come rescue her.</i>

21:20.700 --> 21:23.800
<i>When they do, I'll finish them!</i>

21:27.010 --> 21:28.890
You're awake, Dai!

21:29.560 --> 21:33.600
Popp! Where are we?! Where's Hyunckel?!

21:34.730 --> 21:38.540
He beat us.
The two of us managed to escape.

21:38.540 --> 21:40.170
Where's Maam?!

21:40.170 --> 21:42.030
Hopefully, she's okay.

21:45.280 --> 21:47.660
Our pursuers found us already?!

21:48.740 --> 21:51.330
Hey! Are you hurt?!

21:52.160 --> 21:55.140
You wouldn't happen to be Dai, would you?

21:55.140 --> 21:57.600
How does he know my name?

21:57.600 --> 21:59.420
Who are you?!

22:20.150 --> 22:25.900
<i>yasashisa wa yasashii hito ga tsukaeru mahou</i>

22:20.150 --> 22:25.900
<i>Kindness is the magic of kind people</i>

22:26.070 --> 22:32.910
<i>jaa boku wa tada no hito de iru shikanaino?</i>

22:26.070 --> 22:32.910
<i>Then do I have no choice
But to just be a normal person?</i>

22:33.080 --> 22:36.120
<i>doudarou</i>

22:33.080 --> 22:36.120
<i>I'm not sure</i>

22:38.420 --> 22:44.090
<i>kaeru basho wa ne kawatte yuku kedo</i>

22:38.420 --> 22:44.090
<i>Even if the place I call home may change</i>

22:44.250 --> 22:46.630
<i>naa kaasan boku wa</i>

22:44.250 --> 22:46.630
<i>Listen to me, Mother</i>

22:46.800 --> 22:52.760
<i>mamoru hito wo kaetari shinai</i>

22:46.800 --> 22:52.760
<i>I will never change those I protect</i>

22:53.220 --> 22:57.430
<i>anata wa nannte iukana</i>

22:53.220 --> 22:57.430
<i>I wonder what you'd say</i>

22:57.600 --> 23:01.650
<i>tokiyori yowaki de chippoke de</i>

22:57.600 --> 23:01.650
<i>At times I can be cowardly and small</i>

23:01.810 --> 23:08.110
<i>mayou koto ni mo mayou boku ni nannte iukana</i>

23:01.810 --> 23:08.110
<i>What would you say to me
As I hesitate to even hesitate?</i>

23:08.280 --> 23:13.950
<i>sagashite ita kyou to chigatte</i>

23:08.280 --> 23:13.950
<i>Unlike the today that I sought</i>

23:14.120 --> 23:19.250
<i>ochikonnde shimau boku wo warau no darou</i>

23:14.120 --> 23:19.250
<i>I'm sure you'd laugh at my disappointment</i>

23:34.600 --> 23:36.930
<i>The difference
in their strengths was clear.</i>

23:37.100 --> 23:41.480
<i>Thanks to Crocodine's sacrifice,
Dai and Popp managed to escape.</i>

23:41.650 --> 23:46.400
<i>They begin to form a plan to counter
Hyunckel's overwhelming strength.</i>

23:46.570 --> 23:51.450
<i>The battle to rescue Maam from her prison
in the Underground Palace begins!</i>

23:52.240 --> 23:54.530
DRAGON QUEST The Adventure of Dai<i>,</i>

23:54.700 --> 23:56.410
<i>"The Collaborative Zapple"</i>

23:56.580 --> 23:58.580
<i>The adventure continues!</i>

23:58.580 --> 24:00.580


24:00.580 --> 24:02.580

